            headline: "CD transport — stop deploying from a live runner workspace",
            brief: "The shared root of both tail incidents: the runner checkout is a maximally stateful foreign entity and rsync-from-it is state coupling by construction. Deploy from the merged commit's CONTENT — fetch-by-hash from a store, or a clean host-side git fetch. The whitelist narrowed the foreign-state contract; CD transport deletes it.",
            displaced_cost: "the whole foreign-state contract on the runner checkout",
