            brief: "Two failure classes, both proven live on srv1. Debris: Stop leaves the worktree and `dispatch/<node_id>` branch behind, so the next POST is a typed spawn_failed at the git step. Session-id reuse: even after hand-cleaning, claude exits 1 because the deterministic per-node UUID collides with the archived transcript — one-shot at the claude layer too.",
